40
00:01:41,635 --> 00:01:44,384
It cannot run a shell command on its own.

41
00:01:44,384 --> 00:01:46,329
And when a hop returns stars,

42
00:01:46,329 --> 00:01:49,682
the record marks it unknown instead of filling the

43
00:01:49,682 --> 00:01:49,950
gap.

44
00:01:50,700 --> 00:01:54,074
Day two adds context. Hops are enriched from F5

45
00:01:54,074 --> 00:01:56,515
